{"productId": "c7a40d46-3a97-4ffe-8f37-cd1e52441957", "modelName": "OZ-9 V2 Elite", "modelDescription": "True modularity has been achieved with the release of the OZ9V2. Full customization is at hand with three slide lengths, threaded or non-threaded barrels, and two grip sizes, giving you a total of ten possible configurations to choose from. All from one single platform. Our patented compact steel receiver is the serialized component that can easily be interchanged between grip sizes with the removal of a single pin. The trigger is housed in the steel receiver allowing for grip changes without completely breaking down the pistol. Slide and barrel swaps allow you to now convert a compact to a full-size and back again. OZ9V2 slides are a hybrid design that combine upgraded Gen5 internals and Gen5 barrels with a Gen3 recoil system. This change gives the OZ9V2 its true modularity by utilizing the compact receiver with the three sizes of slide and barrel combinations: Compact, Full-Size, and Long.", "manufacturerName": "ZEV Technologies", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "1016c69d-8b96-46da-a8db-38e61b937dbf", "description": "ZEV Tech, OZ-9c V2 Elite, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 4\" Bronze Barrel, Black Finish, Fiber Optic Sights, Right Hand, 1 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/0e3f1f0c-52db-4c71-8188-dbcb56729c11", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/f9e846e3-dc73-465d-9cad-9c621e3cee96"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "OZ9-V2-E-C-LC", "upc": "811338038326", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70cd5184-05d8-42f1-ace2-3bf16911e463", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "bb23c0a9-9d08-4b62-b022-2a505dd48109", "valueName": "4\""}, {"attributeNameId": "aef7e40b-24db-4f9c-b884-93e539597b02", "attributeName": "Handgun Size", "attributeValueId": "c9cfd9ac-caeb-4c44-b459-cf1e7eb